{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Starfire\u00a0</strong></i>is a classic side-scrolling shooter focused on BOSS battles, with hand-drawn art and animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for high-speed bullet hell 1v1 battles! \u2728\ud83c\udf0c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced boss rush adventure game, you will control the adorable cat fairy Eira\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\ufe0f as you challenge the magically corrupted Constellation Guardians. Dodge, jump, and unleash bullets to experience epic 1 1v1 boss showdowns, collect star fragments, and reignite the stars of a shattered universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Starfire i</strong></i><strong>s a fully solo-developed indie game, so your feedback is incredibly valuable. You can email me directly at <a href=\"mailto:243619756@qq.com\">243619756@qq.com</a>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh Hand-Drawn Art Style</strong><br>All in-game art assets are meticulously hand-painted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6b91df006ece50e59dd2098395c17d76.poster.avif?t=1769065493\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6b91df006ece50e59dd2098395c17d76.webm?t=1769065493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying High-Speed Combat</strong><br>Players nimbly control characters in fast-paced boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6465a144917fc1603bf042f8b9a36bb9.poster.avif?t=1769065493\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6465a144917fc1603bf042f8b9a36bb9.webm?t=1769065493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Bullet Patterns</strong><br>Uniquely crafted bullet patterns adapt to each scene\u2019s visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/c69085033868ce31b5aa348ff283fee7.poster.avif?t=1769065493\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/c69085033868ce31b5aa348ff283fee7.webm?t=1769065493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794670?t=1769065493","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/5eacd8aba8c6132b6b9874ac96486b40cbcaa569/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769065493","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/5761dfbe0dc835c94775ffcdaa0c15e5bdc767e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769065493","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/5761dfbe0dc835c94775ffcdaa0c15e5bdc767e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769065493","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Starfire\u00a0</strong></i>is a classic side-scrolling shooter focused on BOSS battles, with hand-drawn art and animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for high-speed bullet hell 1v1 battles! \u2728\ud83c\udf0c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced boss rush adventure game, you will control the adorable cat fairy Eira\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\ufe0f as you challenge the magically corrupted Constellation Guardians. Dodge, jump, and unleash bullets to experience epic 1 1v1 boss showdowns, collect star fragments, and reignite the stars of a shattered universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Starfire i</strong></i><strong>s a fully solo-developed indie game, so your feedback is incredibly valuable. You can email me directly at <a href=\"mailto:243619756@qq.com\">243619756@qq.com</a>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh Hand-Drawn Art Style</strong><br>All in-game art assets are meticulously hand-painted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6b91df006ece50e59dd2098395c17d76.poster.avif?t=1769065493\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6b91df006ece50e59dd2098395c17d76.webm?t=1769065493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying High-Speed Combat</strong><br>Players nimbly control characters in fast-paced boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6465a144917fc1603bf042f8b9a36bb9.poster.avif?t=1769065493\" w